{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "胡本云自下皆有世界，略不明應、知"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "胡本中自此以下皆有世界名，此略除也"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "為首千佛"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "禮佛一拜"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "作禮一拜"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "禮一拜"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "禮一拜"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "敬寫大佛名經貳佰捌拾捌卷，惟願城隍安泰、百姓康\n寧，府主尚書曹公己躬永壽，繼紹長季，含宅枝羅常然\n慶吉。于時大梁貞明陸季，歲次庚辰伍月十伍日寫記"}
